11994::$$$message_0096_0000_0000$$$::"...Exactly. What am I doing?"[lr]::
11995::$$$message_0096_0000_0001$$$::Apparently the town seems strange, but the only strange thing is my aimlessness.[lr]::
11996::$$$message_0096_0000_0002$$$::There don't seem to be any suspicious signs, but I don't have the slightest intention of entering.[lr]::
11997::$$$message_0096_0000_0003$$$::Now, I'll go back to the town where there's people.::
911995::$$$message_9096_0000_0001$$$::Apparently the town seems strange, but the only strange thing is my aimlessness.[r]::

